# ============================================================================
# CHAOS REDUX - EVENT 016 KRUGER DIRECTORATE WINDOW
# ============================================================================
# Read-only decision-category dashboard authored for vanilla's 502-pixel
# country-decision grid. Ordinary decisions remain the action surface. The
# layout follows the functional bays painted into the 500x620 Directorate shell:
# header, profile, telemetry, control status, navigation/content, and footer.
# ============================================================================

